~ start
It happened in the middle of a stormy night… a sudden tug, a snap, and Patch’s chest button rolled away into the dark.
Now Patch wakes up feeling incomplete, worried, and a little panicked.
Stitch the Needle Fairy flutters in with a warm glow. “Don’t worry, Patch. We’ll find your button… somehow.”
But trouble is already brewing. The mischievous Sock Twins whisper that they “saw something shiny roll by,” but they won’t say more unless Patch completes a little challenge.
The adventure begins here — in the sewing room, the toy shelf, and the laundry basket — where Patch must search, explore, and prove themselves.
=> END
